<title>HONG KONG: TENNIS-FIRST ROUND RESULTS IN HONG KONG SALEM OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FIRST ROUND RESULTS IN HONG KONG SALEM OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the</p>
<p>US$328,000 Hong Kong Salem Open on Wednesday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding)</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Melvin Tong (Hong Kong) 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>4-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Stephane Simian (France) 4-6</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>5-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia)</p>
<p>2-6 7-6 (7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>Guillaume Raoux (France) beat Daniel Nestor (Cnnada) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Neville Godwin (South Africa) beat 6-Martin Damm (Czech</p>
<p>Republic)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Sebastien Lareau (Canada) beat David Skoch (Czech Republic) 6-4</p>
<p>6-0</p>
</text>
